                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "91382d24-d664-3a30-80ef-7721967eeaa8",
                        "entry_id": "573b8841-7e27-3f2c-86f7-9dcb24979614",
                        "glosses": [
                            "In an unwitting manner; inadvertently, obliviously, unintentionally, unknowingly."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1ce41931-cc59-4605-8945-9f98cde73c16",
                                "sense_id": "91382d24-d664-3a30-80ef-7721967eeaa8",
                                "text": "She realized to her horror that she had unwittingly helped those people she most despised."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f0e853b3-e7c9-4346-9be0-7d2cfb061044",
                                "sense_id": "91382d24-d664-3a30-80ef-7721967eeaa8",
                                "text": "This morning, / Paprs of State he ſent me, to peruſe / As I required: and wot you what I found / There (on my Conſcience put vnwittingly) […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "85b22c18-59d8-4329-9cab-9a1c914ba7fc",
                                "sense_id": "91382d24-d664-3a30-80ef-7721967eeaa8",
                                "text": "[O]nly now it remained that I inquire whether I have right to enter the city of refuge: so I found, that he must not, who lay in wait to shed blood: It was not the wilful murderer, but he who unwittingly did it, he who did it unawares; not out of spite, or grudge, or malice, he that shed it unwittingly: even he who did not hate his neighbour before. Wherefore, […] I thought verily I was the man that must enter, because I had smitten my neighbour unwittingly, and hated Him not aforetime."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c2608d3a-3547-4ab7-bba2-4e4a0e0b6629",
                                "sense_id": "91382d24-d664-3a30-80ef-7721967eeaa8",
                                "text": "I have had a deep sense of the sad consequences of mistakes, in things capital; and their impossibility of recovering when compleated; and what grief of heart it brings to a tender conscience, to have been unwittingly encouraging of the sufferings of the innocent."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "13d63ee2-50e7-44e5-8965-07926841c249",
                                "sense_id": "91382d24-d664-3a30-80ef-7721967eeaa8",
                                "text": "Of course those ministers who did support this did so unwittingly in most instances, did they not? By unwittingly I mean not knowing that the whole program was controlled and dominated and instigated by the Communist Party."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "09af7b6b-a23c-4abc-8c98-ff04cf0b635d",
                                "sense_id": "91382d24-d664-3a30-80ef-7721967eeaa8",
                                "text": "In the fall of 2016, [Hugh] Hefner was the subject of rumors about his health. As per his wishes, he was to be buried in a crypt next to that of Marilyn Monroe, who'd unwittingly helped launch Playboy into the multi-million-dollar business it became."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ee5a6782-df6e-412f-8dca-919d37275255",
                                "sense_id": "91382d24-d664-3a30-80ef-7721967eeaa8",
                                "text": "\"She had asked at Paddington for a return to Lympstone on the Exmouth branch, where her son was due to pass out as a Royal Marine that afternoon, at the local training camp.\n\"Presumably, the booking clerk had misheard her and sold her a ticket to Leominster, and other helpful staff had unwittingly helped her on her way."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "91b0342e-303e-4fad-860a-013e220603ec",
                                "sense_id": "91382d24-d664-3a30-80ef-7721967eeaa8",
                                "text": "Germany is a nation on the brink. On Tuesday, perhaps unwittingly, a handful of members of parliament decided to see how much further they could push it."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
